# Instrument samples. Every tune's voice ships, because all five tunes can be
# chosen from the grown-ups screen and one whose samples were never committed
# would be silent. The rest exist only so a tune can be auditioned on another
# voice (npm run music:preview -- --instrument koto) and would otherwise be a
# few hundred KB of precached audio nobody ever hears.
# Re-fetch them with: node tools/fetch-instruments.mjs
public/audio/instruments/*/
!public/audio/instruments/acoustic_guitar_nylon/
!public/audio/instruments/celesta/
!public/audio/instruments/marimba/
!public/audio/instruments/music_box/
!public/audio/instruments/sitar/
!public/audio/instruments/glockenspiel/
